  "content": "<center>\n  <h3>\n將 CITResewn 移植到 NeoForge！\n  </h3>\n</center>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n\n##\n\n<center>\n   請回報任何問題！\n  <br/>\n  <br/>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.miros.love\">\n    <img src=\"\nhttps://img.shields.io/badge/discord-5865f2?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=ffffff&logo=data:image/png;base64,\n\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/HiWord9/CITResewnNeoPatcher/issues\">\n    <img src=\"\nhttps://img.shields.io/badge/issue%20tracker-000000?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=ffffff&logo=data:image/png;base64,\n\"/>\n  </a>\n</center>\n<br/>\n\nCITResewnNeoPatcher旨在維持[CIT Resewn](https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn)和[Sinytra Connector](https://modrinth.com/mod/connector)的兼容性，讓它可以在NeoForge上運行。這很重要，因為存在個別兼容性問題阻止CIT Resewn與Connector正常運作。\n\n模塊需要安裝[CIT Resewn](https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn)、[Sinytra Connector](https://modrinth.com/mod/connector)和[Forgified Fabric Api](https://modrinth.com/mod/forgified-fabric-api)才能正常工作。\n\n它也作為將[RP Renames](https://modrinth.com/mod/rp-renames)移植到NeoForge的方式而創建，它與Connector兼容，但在NeoForge上沒有可用的CIT系統，因此這沒有意義。\n\n當前可用版本：\n\n|MC|CITResewn|NeoPatcher|\n|---|---|---|\n|1.21.1|[1.2.0-1.2.2](https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn/version/1.2.2+1.21)|1.2.0|",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
